                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b877cbd7-ee08-4c6d-a670-da897b2ca2e1",
                                                "sense_id": "5cbd843a-0414-3be7-a4dc-28537ee0e247",
                                                "text": "Ah, those Indian warehouses made the morning pass in a charming manner! many a soft confession was whispered over a huge china jar; many a heart has succumbed to a suite of mother-of-pearl card-box and counters; and as to the shawls, why, the whole feminine world has long ago acknowledged them to be irresistible."
